Our business strategy may, from time-to-time, include acquiring or investing in complementary services, technologies or
businesses, such as our acquisition of MedSupport in 2017 and our acquisition of New Aera in 2019. We do not have an extensive
history of acquiring other companies and cannot assure you that we will successfully identify suitable acquisition candidates, integrate
